{"unit_id":"advance-lion__dsh-brand#card-zh","repo":"advance-lion/dsh-brand","commit":"85b77a5398d82b0ae65ff6344ae81de5e6658742","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-brand 是面向 DSH Web 的界面品牌定制插件。它通过客户端品牌插槽和宿主配置接口接入，将自定义标识、名称、版本与新会话页头内容显示在侧栏和 Hero 区域，并可替换浏览器标题与图标。用户可从品牌设置页编辑配置，调整思考和运行状态文案、按钮图标及品牌主色作用范围，也可隐藏内测提示。配置保存在 DSH_HOME 下的 JSON 文件；无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:578-590","lib/client.js:878-880","lib/index.js:188-237"]}
{"unit_id":"advance-lion__dsh-brand#card-en","repo":"advance-lion/dsh-brand","commit":"85b77a5398d82b0ae65ff6344ae81de5e6658742","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-brand customizes the DSH web interface. It replaces sidebar and new-session logos, names, versions, and hero text, and can set the browser title and icon. Its settings page edits status labels, button icons, and brand color scope. Config is stored under DSH_HOME; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:578-590","lib/client.js:878-880","lib/index.js:188-237"]}
